WEBVTT

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.013
to fight against the climate crisis,

00:06:00.037 --> 00:06:01.748
because we need you.

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:09.206
AG: Four people, four stories
of success and change.

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:11.422
Immediately after this Countdown event,

00:06:11.446 --> 00:06:15.336
"24 Hours of Reality"
will begin around the world

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:19.057
at 4pm Eastern
Standard Time in the US,

00:06:19.081 --> 00:06:22.647
featuring thousands of presentations
from climate leaders

00:06:22.671 --> 00:06:25.366
just like the ones you've just seen.

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:27.376
Use your voice,

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.387
find your power,

00:06:29.411 --> 00:06:31.576
find your passion.